  "abstract": "{\"id\":\"ad.tools.star_task_task_video_data.get\",\"title\":\"获取升级版巨量引擎工作台账户星广联投视频数据\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/tools/ebp/star_task/task_video_data/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"capability_summary\":\"用于获取升级版巨量引擎工作台账户下星广联投任务的视频相关数据，支持按账户ID、任务ID、统计时间范围、素材ID、素材结算类型等条件过滤查询，返回视频基础信息、投放消耗、转化数据、素材评估标签等多维度指标，支持分页和自定义排序，适用于星广联投任务的视频效果数据分析场景。\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-cj5i8od2tgg00\">获取升级版巨量引擎工作台账户星广联投视频数据</p><div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A1866944059708938%2C%22docLibId%22%3A1743864733602830%2C%22id%22%3A%22cz0Zb%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"> </div><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-4yubr5aztdo00\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-4yubr5aztdo00\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-elk0c33nrrs00\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/tools/ebp/star_task/task_video_data/get/<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1868950518957124\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-4elp51tymp000\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-4elp51tymp000\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-3vxesbcjftk00\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-ekijo9ubodc00\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-ekijo9ubodc00\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-dfvjh41kfbk00\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-dfvjh41kfbk00\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-ak2mv2ykg0800\">账户ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">账户类型，可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-cx1bgd9rlug00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-7v2gf00zy3800\"><code>EBP</code> 升级版巨量引擎工作台账户</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">star_task_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-5h6rsgzxfqs000\">任务ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">start_date</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">数据统计开始时间，格式：YYYY-MM-DD</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">end_date</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">数据统计结束时间，格式：YYYY-MM-DD</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">filtering</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-2074u0qc4fvk00\">过滤器</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">material_ids</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-4sgy6cm2joo000\">按素材id过滤，需要传入任务下绑定的素材id方可查询到数据</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">star_material_purchase_method</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"> 素材结算类型，可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-7juika1b7hs00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-2fdrkjr22hz400\"><code>FIXED_PRICE</code> 一口价</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-3pz2mguc6cy000\"><code>PERFORMANCE_BASED</code> 效果化</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">order_field</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-49726ixnuja000\">排序字段，默认按照<code>stat_cost</code>营销消耗倒序排序</p><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-1seedxy90z9c00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1r88eiox2qlc00\">关联营销消耗 （实时）（stat_cost）</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-2hho4op098u000\">达人流量消耗及素材费（实时）（non_ad_stat_cost）</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-3pwy82meq60000\">达人流量消耗（实时）（star_stat_cost）</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1ckfldl5s2n400\">达人流量转化数（实时）（star_convert_cnt）</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-134qwwvemvlc00\">基础素材费（实时）（star_material_stat_cost）</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-37ys40g7tpa000\">素材分成费（实时）（star_sale_material_stat_cost）</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-2x46wnyc3fw000\">预估应用内营销分成（实时）(in_app_stat_cost_range_t1)</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-3pvqh52v4ok000\">预估应用内付费金额（实时）（in_app_payment_amount_range_t1）</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-5tnpdrvlr0w000\">视频自然播放量（实时）(star_material_natural_views_t1)</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-2y6xtlpdozi000\">自然CPM （实时）(star_cpm)</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-5ftwxtd9lxg000\">达人流量消耗-安卓端（stat_anaroid_cost）</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-jpgywoe2py000\">达人流量消耗-IOS端（stat_ios_cost）</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1rtyoem66skg00\">达人流量转化数-安卓端（android_convert_cnt）</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-5b2d2e11tu8000\">达人流量转化数-IOS端（ios_convert_cnt）</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">order_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">排序方式，可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-1bj4hcj5ytuo00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-7gylpvmrj7g00\"><code>ASC</code> </li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-36673elrstq000\"><code>DESC</code> </li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-4r7ytjzg64y000\">页码，默认值<code>1</code></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page_size</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">页面大小，默认值<code>10</code>，数值范围[1,100]</section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-cdnifjk1xkw00\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-cdnifjk1xkw00\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.par