escription\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-22xiuryfzmow00\">视频关联营销数，实时数据</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">stat_cost</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>float</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-zpr0qyos0lc00\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">视频关联营销消耗（元）</span></p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-41z5nb4y68m000\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">表示营销在投放期内的预估花费金额。当天数据可能会有波动，次日稳定</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">non_ad_stat_cost</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>float</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-bh3jl9ewdc000\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">达人流量消耗及素材费（元）</span></p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-39zhvm5po94000\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">达人流量消耗、基础素材费和素材分成费合计</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">star_stat_cost</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>float</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-2qu8yd6rzki000\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">达人流量消耗（元）</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">stat_android_cost</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>float</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-54ju15yyi1c000\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">达人流量消耗-安卓端</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">stat_ios_cost</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>float</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-4uaagg2hd14000\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">达人流量消耗- IOS端</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">star_material_stat_cost</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>float</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-4ovkdef2r2i000\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">基础素材费（元）</span></p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-218lcf15pf9c00\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">基础素材费 = 基础素材费单价*投稿视频数</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">star_sale_material_stat_cost</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>float</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-4ozim0ralde000\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">素材分成费（元）</span></p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-2kk5mpgw7lk00\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">素材分成费 = 星广联投任务关联营销消耗 * 素材分成费比例</span></p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-12yr5hc8jrlc00\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">素材分成费比例限免中，限免期间获取到的素材分成费为0</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">star_install_finish_count</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col descri