ection class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">install_finish_cnt</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1ny6e992i9xc00\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">营销流量安装数</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">active</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-54v8dbr7uk0000\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">营销流量激活数</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">active_register</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1rks29v78hpc00\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">营销流量注册数</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">active_pay</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-394niksk1oe000\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">营销流量首次付费数</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">game_pay_count</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1mfs2tfqqi3k00\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">营销流量付费数</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">star_material_purchase_method</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"> <span style=\"color: #000000;\">素材结算类型</span>，枚举值：<br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-32my09tf4y2000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-4745fyzd1ra000\"><code>FIXED_PRICE</code> 一口价</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-7tnlkrs8amg00\"><code>PERFORMANCE_BASED</code> 效果化</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">star_material_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-5jsg2990dng000\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">视频素材标签，此标签仅支持星广联投游戏版，枚举值：</span></p><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-39crve7y49w000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-2zygfkta6ns000\"><code>FIXED_PRICE_MATERIAL</code> 一口价达人素材，指由您自己出资采买、按一口价结算的达人素材</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-29sl9ezu4wsg00\"><code>HIGH_POTENTIAL_MATERIAL</code> 高潜达人素材，由平台出资、按一口价结算的高质量达人素材</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1amm3t9nwheo00\"><code>PERFORMANCE_BASED_MATERIAL</code> 效果化达人素材，指按效果结算的达人素材</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">star_material_display_format</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">视频呈现形式</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">star_material_creative_orient</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">视频创意方向</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">isv_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">服务商ID</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">isv_name</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">服务商名称</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">star_video_material_assessment</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"> <span style=\"color: #000000;\">素材评估标签，枚举值：</span><br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-jrap708xdao00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-3fqdfdywmqe000\"><code>AUDIT_FAIL_MATERIAL</code> 审核不通过</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-72yjbgzh9lg0\"><code>CARRY_MATERIAL</code> 搬运素材</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-4dwn37do330000\"><code>DELIVERING_MATERIAL</code> 投放中</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-2nct4ol424s000\"><code>FIRST_PUBLISH_MATERIAL</code> 首发素材</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-41iyxjx1t4a000\"><code>HIGH_QUALITY_MATERIAL</code> 优质素材</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-4g8tlm7oie4000\"><code>INEFFICIENT_MATERIAL</code> 低效素材</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-9ng9rn0yw0g00\"><code>LOW_QUALITY_MATERIAL</code> 低质素材</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-2zv4589pc12000\"><code>SIMILAR_MATERIAL</code> 同质化素材</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-le